            "Teams that deploy continuously may hardly need a delivery planning meeting, because every finished item is released on its own. Teams with release trains, regulated sign-off or customer training usually do. For a full replenishment agenda, prioritisation with classes of service and a worked replenishment example, read our guide to [Kanban planning](/project-management/kanban/kanban-planning/).",
