                ["Items needed to meet 85%", "0.85 × 18 = 15.3, rounded up", "16 of 18"],
                ["85th percentile this fortnight", "Value at rank 0.85 × 18 = 15.3, rounded up to 16, in the sorted list", "12 days, against an SLE of 10"],
                ["Ageing work now", "Current item ages: 1, 2, 2, 3, 5, 6, 8, 11, 13 days", "2 of 9 in-progress items already past the SLE"],
