                "**Risk review** looks for recurring causes of delay and feeds responses into policies and classes of service.",
                "**Replenishment** selects work to start within those priorities and policies.",
                "**Daily Kanban meeting** manages the flow of committed work.",
                "**Delivery planning** hands finished work over to customers.",
